            "review_title": "Review at Speit Mac & Cheese",
            "review_text": "Dương Hân\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nDuring this trip, I went into small alleys in District 5 to explore family restaurants\nOct 2023 • Friends\nDishes are 80% Cheese so quite fatty. But it's very delicious and suits my taste. Especially you must eat the cheese pasta because it is very delicious, the combination of the fat of the pasta with the cheese and beef is wonderful. There are also great side dishes like chicken cartilage and cheese-filled chicken balls. Recomend you should try the fruit teas and sodas here because they are very delicious\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten December 29, 2023",
